00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:42.360
Let's think about this more deeply.

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.480
Yes, Miss Anna!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:51.900
I had a lot of trouble investigating the
Angel's Maneuver,

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.840
because there are very few records of
people who've attempted it.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.240
Well, that's only natural, though.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:02.110
It requires extraordinarily harsh training,
but it's not even flashy.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:06.970
Everyone came to think that anyone who
attempted such a thing was a fool.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:12.080
Now there's hardly anybody
who even knows what it is.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.460
Sora.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.620
Yes?

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:20.130
If you attempt the Angel's Maneuver and fail,

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:23.100
all that will be waiting for you
is scornful laughter.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.830
Will you really walk this path?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.370
Yes.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.870
You're convinced this is the path to
being a true star, aren't you?

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:35.670
Actually, it's more like right now I just want
to try my hand at this maneuver.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:41.320
Even if I think about what's going to happen
afterwards, it's not like I'll somehow know,

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:44.180
and I don't want to not do it
and then have regrets.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:48.990
My parents died when I was small,
leaving me behind.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:52.360
I'm sure they had all kinds of things
they wanted to do,

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.020
so I think maybe dying really stung.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:59.630
So I live life trying everything.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.670
I see.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:06.870
And I understand how much it stung Sophie that
she couldn't bring off the Angel's Maneuver...

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:14.020
Sora. Do you know why Sophie died?

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.280
No...

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.050
I killed her.

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:31.530
Just before the Festival three years ago,

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:36.230
I happened to see Leon and Sophie
practicing the Angel's Maneuver.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:41.440
It was something I could tell with
one look wasn't perfected.

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.810
It wasn't something that

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:48.080
could possibly have jeopardized Layla's
victory with the Golden Phoenix.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:53.850
But what I was afraid of then was
Leon's presence in my world.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:11:00.660
I thought that if Kalos called Leon to
Kaleido Stage, my position would be in danger.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:03.860
But at the time I had ambitions.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.970
I had ambitions to rout out Kalos,
the cause of my father's death,

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:11.530
and seize control of the Kaleido Stage.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.910
On the day of the Festival,

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:18.810
I called her to a park a ways off from the arena.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:22.350
I lied, telling her I had something to say to her.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:26.050
She kept waiting for me when there was
no way I'd show up,

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:29.790
and then at the last possible moment
she tried to return to the arena.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:33.160
On her way back, she was in an accident.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:39.630
Leon called me countless times
from the hospital.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.340
He asked me again and again to meet with her
before she passed on,

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:44.610
crying as he spoke the words.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:47.280
Sophie is smitten with you.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.440
Please!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:51.080
Tell her you weren't trying to trick her!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:54.580
Please don't let her die with a wounded heart!

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:57.070
I'm begging you! PLEASE!

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:02.280
It was almost my turn to perform; he must
have known there was no way I'd come.

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:06.080
You... did something like that...

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:09.230
I can become a demon at any time.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:12.960
Only a true demon can raise an angel.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:21.640
If you're going to try to become an angel,
you'll have to accept a demon for a partner.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.710
I intend to settle things with Leon.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:28.840
Whichever one of us can become a
true demon will be your partner.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.690
Yuri's Pisces and Leon's Scorpio...

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:38.420
The curtain is about to rise on a battle
more fierce than any that has come before.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.870
It's been a long time since Sora's
had a leading part, huh?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.110
I know, I'm looking forward to it!

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.080
Now if only May wasn't here...

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.410
Tell me about it.

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.580
Oh, Sora, good luck!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.240
Show May how much better you are than her!

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.620
All finished already?

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:05.140
I don't have that much stuff.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.420
There we go...

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.020
It's great that you got to have
your old room back, huh?

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:11.330
Yeah. Thanks for everything!

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:16.060
It looks like everybody's excited
about your lead role.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:19.000
Yeah, I'm happy about that,

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:21.700
but I wish they'd get along with May too...

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:22.970
With May?

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:26.930
Yeah. After all she is one of us,
performing on the same stage...

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.010
Maybe that's Mia and the others?

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.670
Yes, I'm coming!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:33.780
May...

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:34.920
Is there someone here?

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.880
Yeah, Rosetta...

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.320
I thought that might happen.
It's a good thing I came prepared.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.290
I'm coming in.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:44.420
Er, okay. Come on in. Come all the way in...

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:46.660
You come too, Rosetta.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.060
Huh? Come where?

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:51.000
May, you don't have to come THAT far in...

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.070
Um, what are you doing?

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.940
You'll drink cola, right?

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.470
What's this about?

00:13:57.470 --> 00:14:01.180
I'm sure you'll do a comeback party
and stuff with your friends,

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:02.970
but I don't go to things like that.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.010
I see you're as dense as ever.

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.180
I'm saying let's make a toast!

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.180
Huh?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.790
I intend to have you show me your best
Odette in this show.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.460
I'm going to give the part of Odile my all,

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:18.620
so that people will say she shines
more than Odette does.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.060
May!

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.800
But if you ever look like you're flagging,

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.270
I'm standing by ready to steal your role anytime.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.100
Right.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:33.160
Receiving Sagittarius' light,
Taurus grows brighter as well.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.870
Okay then, let's make a toast!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:36.240
Cheers!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.380
That's not really a toast, it's more like...

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.580
This is the way we do it in my family!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.820
Come on, shake shake shake shake shake!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:46.790
Boy, for a second there I was worried
about whether I...

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:47.460
Cheers!

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:47.460
Boy, for a second there I was worried
about whether I...

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:47.690
Boy, for a second there I was worried
about whether I...

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:48.420
Cheers!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:48.420
Boy, for a second there I was worried
about whether I...

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.290
Just so you know,

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.390
I totally don't believe in this "stage with no
battles" thing you keep talking about.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.040
The reality is, you won against me
and got the lead role.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.910
I intend to win against you someday.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.910
Right.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.380
That's the way things work, isn't it?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.610
Yeah... But I don't feel like this is fighting.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:15.250
Maybe that's because I've been able
to make friends with you.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:18.490
Well, you don't piss me off as much as
you did before, either.

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:21.320
Why don't you make friends with
everyone else in the cast too?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.860
You've got to be joking.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.790
Make friends with riffraff who are all talk
but don't do anything?

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.460
They're not like that.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.830
They're all doing their best.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.400
Sora.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.600
What?

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.970
Let's go back to the stage again.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:36.040
Huh?

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.570
Show me what your stage is like.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.110
Right now?

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.280
Of course, practice starts tomorrow!

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.070
Okay...

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.070
I'm impressed, you came
instead of running away.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.930
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:13.500
I thought I'd give you a chance
to take your revenge.

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:15.380
You hate me, don't you?

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:18.040
I'm the man who caused Sophie's death.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.880
Then take that sword and face me.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.980
What's the matter? Can't you do it?

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.330
Why don't I reveal who the
God of Death really is?

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:35.100
You're no God of Death.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:37.100
And you're not searching for a partner, either.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:40.430
For the past three years, you've just
been relieving your own mind,

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:44.370
confirming over and over that no one
could take Sophie's place.

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:48.240
But then Sora came along.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:53.450
You must have noticed right away that she
had abilities that rivaled Sophie's.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.520
You gave Sora special training
out of the blue like that

00:16:55.520 --> 00:17:00.180
because you thought if you gave her the test
for the Angel's Maneuver she'd pass it.

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:03.720
You were hoping SORA would be
the one to run away.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:07.430
But Sora never gave up.

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:09.900
You were afraid of her.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:13.630
If things went on like that, the
Angel's Maneuver training would continue.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.040
If that happened,

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:19.840
you'd have to acknowledge that you're a coward
who can't completely turn into a demon.

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.310
You're wrong!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.680
The reason Sophie couldn't become an angel

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.510
was because you couldn't
completely become a demon.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:29.480
For you, those days while Sophie's
lukewarm training continued

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.480
were more important than her
turning into an angel.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:37.160
Because that was the only way your
cowardice would remain undiscovered.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.920
You're the one who's most relieved that
Sophie's dead, am I right?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.100
What did you say?!

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:47.270
Because you got by without your
deceit being found out.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:48.740
Shut up!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.440
Be grateful to me, Leon!

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:54.310
Because I freed you from your suffering.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:58.050
Sophie's dream was a millstone
around your neck, wasn't it?

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.010
Admit it.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.010
DON'T YOU SAY ANOTHER WORD!

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.320
What's that sound?

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:06.750
Is someone in there?

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.190
At this time of night?

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.960
I intend to settle things with Leon.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:20.530
Whichever one of us can become a
true demon will be your partner.

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:29.500
Sophie might have realized your
true colors long before she died!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.210
SHUT UP!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.700
Sora!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.280
That's right.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.770
This is fine.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.150
I'm satisfied with this...

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:16.790
Stop it.

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.720
Sora!

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.100
Both of you, stop it!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.590
This is a stage!

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:30.100
I can't believe you'd hurt each other on a stage!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.780
No matter which one of you
becomes my partner,

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:38.550
an Angel's Maneuver that can't be created
without doing things like this...

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:41.210
A maneuver like that is meaningless!

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:46.850
The stage is grieving. Can't you tell?!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:53.920
When fighting and hatred hang over
the stage, it grieves.

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:58.660
You say the same things as Sophie...

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.840
I promised her.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:08.070
I promised I'd perfect the Angel's Maneuver
and make the "true star" a reality.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:13.440
A true star will wreathe the stage in smiles.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.880
Everyone's hearts will come together as one...

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:22.720
The performers and the audience...
will be like a family...

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:26.060
Promise me, Leon...

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.790
Yes.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.470
Sophie? Sophie!

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.000
Sophie!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:51.250
But the truth is, I wasn't confident that
a true star could really exist.

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:56.590
And that "stage without battles"
that Sophie dreamed of...

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:58.990
I still couldn't understand it.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:01.560
She left behind the promise alone.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:05.300
Sora is the only one who can
make good on that promise.

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:11.760
And the only one who can raise her
to be an angel is you, Leon.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:17.780
Time stopped for you three years ago
when Sophie died, and it hasn't moved since.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:22.920
I thought if you could start moving by
getting revenge on me, I'd gladly help, but...

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.620
You did this on purpose?!

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.820
I was doing it to atone.

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:29.760
For what I did to Sophie,

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.360
and for what I did to Layla.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.760
You're an idiot.

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:34.730
Miss Layla!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.500
You called me all the way over here for that?

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:40.730
You haven't done anything to me
that you need to atone for.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.640
The value of the victory doesn't change.

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:45.370
You know about Miss Sophie...

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:49.540
I heard from Yuri, just a little while ago.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.850
A stage without battles...

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:56.550
It sounds like Sophie was aiming to become a
true star without fighting anyone too.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:22:02.590
I can't believe that that's possible,
but there is one thing I've figured out.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.190
Miss Layla?

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:08.460
There's something very important that I forgot
to take care of before I left the stage.

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:11.700
It's all right, Yuri.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:14.690
Leon will become Sora's partner.

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:19.170
If you mean to make good on your promise,
this is your last chance.

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:23.070
Yes.

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:27.070
You're right.

